# 711 - Custom Class Configuration Schema

## Status
- Created: 2026-04-05
- Phase: 2
- Priority: High
- Depends on: 345 (custom talent interface), 163 (custom resource bars)

## Current Behavior
- Custom classes defined in `src/lua/custom-classes.lua`
- Flat spell list with level, sourceClass, and implicit auto-learn
- No distinction between trainer abilities and talents
- No talent tree structure defined

## Intended Behavior
- Clear separation between trainer abilities and talent tree spells
- Indexed by spell ID for fast lookup
- Talent tree structure with tiers, prerequisites, and arrow blocking
- Automatic rank detection via spell name + source class
- Support for skipping ranks (e.g., R1, R3, R5 = 3 points for full effect)

